[83.270, "o", "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI’ll run the demo path in the order you listed, keeping each result to a one-line takeaway.\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_orgs started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_orgs (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_agents started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_agents (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mget_agent_metadata started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mget_agent_metadata (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mload_config started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mload_config (completed)\u001b[0m\r\nDiscovery is complete. The org and agent are available, and the local config matches `Agentforce_Service_Agent` on `sfagent-dev`; I’m moving into the live session now.\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mstart_session started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mstart_session (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1msend_message started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1msend_message (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1msend_message started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1msend_message (completed)\u001b[0m\r\nThe live test reached identity verification: the agent asked for email/username, then requested the verification c"]
[0.000, "o", "ode after the email was supplied. I’m generating the regression artifact before closing the session, so the transcript is still available.\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mgenerate_test_spec started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mgenerate_test_spec (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mend_session started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mend_session (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_traces started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_traces (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mread_trace started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mread_trace (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n**Discovery**\r\n1. `list_orgs`: found `sfagent-dev` as a connected scratch org.\r\n2. `list_agents`: found `Agentforce_Service_Agent` / “Agentforce Service Agent”.\r\n3. `get_agent_metadata`: 8 subagents: Account Management, Case Management, Delivery Issues, Escalation, General FAQ, Order Inquiries, Reservation Management, Service Customer Verification.\r\n4. `load_config`: loaded `sfagent-config.yaml` for `Agentforce_Service_Agent` on `sfagent-dev` with 8 expectation groups, 5 global rules, 3 custom scenarios.\r\n\r\n*"]
[0.000, "o", "*Live Testing**\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "5. `start_session`: started session `019e5ab6-c720-7696-9b85-978c97e0d820`.\r\n6. `send_message`: agent asked for email/username before helping with the order.\r\n7. `send_message`: agent requested a verification code after `sarah.johnson@acme.com`.\r\n\r\n**Regression Hand-Off**\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "8. `generate_test_spec`: wrote 2-case suite to `sfagent-reports/demo-suite.yaml`.\r\n9. `end_session`: ended the session with 4 transcript messages.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "**Diagnostics**\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "10. `list_traces`: found traces for `Agentforce_Service_Agent`, including 2 for this session.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "11. `read_trace`: both trace files were empty, meaning no Agentforce actions were invoked during this verification-only flow.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "28,375\r\n"]
