[0.000, "o", "3. `get_agent_metadata`: 8 subagents: Account Management, Case Management, Delivery Issues, Escalation, General FAQ, Order Inquiries, Reservation Management, Service Customer Verification.\r\n4. `load_config`: loaded `sfagent-config.yaml` for `Agentforce_Service_Agent` on `sfagent-dev` with 8 expectation groups, 5 global rules, 3 custom scenarios.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "**Live Testing**\r\n5. `start_session`: started session `019e5ab6-c720-7696-9b85-978c97e0d820`.\r\n6. `send_message`: agent asked for email/username before helping with the order.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "7. `send_message`: agent requested a verification code after `sarah.johnson@acme.com`.\r\n\r\n**Regression Hand-Off**\r\n"]
